int }_{-a}^{a}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=2{\\int }_{0}^{a}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nNotice that $f(x)={x}^{2}-3$ is an even function. Indeed, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-x) & =((-x)^{2}-3) \\\\  & =({x}^{2}-3) \\\\  & =f(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, because $f(x)=({x}^{2}-3)$ is an even function, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-9}^{9}({x}^{2}-3)\\,\\text{d}x=2{\\int }_{0}^{9}({x}^{2}-3)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14014138/state.json" "file_sha256" "9271e52d31e0b6b012a34f18bc1103d64ceb6c2e038f1fe49e0407440395290f"} {"question" "q-88582" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14014138/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "719d109e0f263a23944557d97e05a7591b3925e13f943ab431df7e88d5f39d5f"} {"question" "q-88582" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14014138/state.json" "file_sha256" "9271e52d31e0b6b012a34f18bc1103d64ceb6c2e038f1fe49e0407440395290f"} {"question" "q-88582" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-{\\int }_{0}^{9}({x}^{2}-3)\\,\\text{d}x"] ["math" "0"] ["math" "2{\\int }_{0}^{9}({x}^{2}-3)\\,\\text{d}x"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{9}({x}^{2}-3)\\,\\text{d}x"] ["math" "{\\int }_{0}^{9}({x}^{2}-3)\\,\\text{d}x"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14014138/state.json" "file_sha256" "9271e52d31e0b6b012a34f18bc1103d64ceb6c2e038f1fe49e0407440395290f"} {"question" "q-88582" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2{\\int }_{0}^{9}({x}^{2}-3)\\,\\text{d}x"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Develop